  "changelogDate": null,
  "originalDescriptionHtml": "<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><strong style=\"background-color: lightblue; color: darkslateblue;\" class=\"ql-size-huge\">饥饿游戏：旧城迷行</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: palevioletred;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">①玩法介绍</strong></p><p><span class=\"ql-size-large\">局外，玩家需要到达</span><strong class=\"ql-size-large\" style=\"color: orange;\">天赋区</strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\">选择</span><strong class=\"ql-size-large\" style=\"color: orange;\">天赋</strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\">（12种），为了给玩家更好的游戏体验，我们设置了</span><strong class=\"ql-size-large\" style=\"color: orange;\">天气/时间调节屋</strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\">。点击按钮开始游戏，每个玩家将会传送到不同的区域，游戏内每个玩家各自为战，通过点燃TNT来获得物资，局内设有铁砧和工作台，为玩家提供合成以及附魔需求。</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: palevioletred;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">②道具介绍</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: orange;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">雪球 </strong><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">: </strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\"> 投掷后冰冻小范围内的其他玩家。</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: orange;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">末影珍珠 </strong><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">: </strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\">投掷后将会获得隐身，力量buff。</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: orange;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">鸡蛋</strong><strong class=\"ql-size-large\"> : </strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\"> 投掷后有概率获得绿宝石和不死图腾。</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: palevioletred;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">③特殊地区</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: orange;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">古堡</strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\">：使用80绿宝石在王座上召唤烈焰骑士及其随从，击败后有概率掉落烈焰棒，可在河边兑奖屋兑换神器:</span><strong class=\"ql-size-large\" style=\"color: orange;\">三叉戟</strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\">。</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: orange;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">兑奖屋</strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\">：消耗64绿宝石随机获得两种高级套装的其中一件。#如果绿宝石不足会被吞噬掉</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: orange;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">巫女地摊</strong><span class=\"ql-size-large\">：位于西集市，可以消耗苹果使游戏内任意一名玩家身边召唤出尸壳。</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: palevioletred;\" class=\"ql-size-large\">④其他</strong></p><p><span class=\"ql-size-large\">等待无聊？可以在天赋区游玩跑酷，也可以在大厅选择打凋零和冰船游玩，等待下一局开始。</span></p><p><span class=\"ql-size-large\">——E建</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: goldenrod;\" class=\"ql-size-large\"><em>饥饿游戏-旧城迷行v2.0更新日志</em></strong></p><p>扩大出生点范围，优化冰船游戏.</p><p>地图内新增部分建筑及建筑内饰.</p><p>优化了部分已发现的：bug.</p><p>优化了公告栏.</p><p>新增胜利榜，上局获胜显示.</p><p>下调绿宝石消耗及上调获取量.</p><p>新增定时饥饿buff.</p><p>新增死斗玩法.</p><p><strong style=\"color: goldenrod;\"><em>本次更新人员：</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: deepskyblue;\">建造老e</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: deepskyblue;\">水晶215</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: deepskyblue;\">初风sky</strong></p><p><span class=\"ql-size-large\">﻿</span><img src=\"https://x19.fp.ps.netease.com/file/62ebc73100722e6648db1e80Hb0ogs3R04\"></p>",
